  "modelingNotes": [
    "The principal polygon and 15 m total roof height come from OSM. Its untagged roof rise is interpreted as 4 m from the inspected front and oblique Commons images; the shallow polygonal roof uses an 18 m inset.",
    "Two-storey rear annex and uncovered service footprint use an explicitly inferred 7 m eave/8 m roof. The central lantern radius 2.8 m and 17.2 m crown are visual estimates relative to the mapped auditorium; its height is not surveyed.",
    "Upper window band, corner pilasters and strong horizontal cornices retain the characteristic circus silhouette. Relief friezes, horses, lettering and ornamental colors are omitted; the shared restrained palette is used."
  ],
